<title>BULGARIA: WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - JUNE 11 - SUNNY, WARM.</title>
<headline>WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - JUNE 11 - SUNNY, WARM.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunny and warm across the country, rain expected in the afternoon, state radio said.</p>
<p>Maximum temperatures are expected between 23 and 28 degrees, temperature in Sofia is seen at about 25 degrees.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
